uardo saverin, and his character's relationship with mark is the emotional core of the film.\n\nthe film's cinematography is also noteworthy, with david fincher using a muted color palette to create a sense of detachment and isolation. the score by trent reznor and atticus ross is also excellent, and it adds to the film's sense of tension and unease.\n\noverall, the social network is a film that is both entertaining and thought-provoking. it raises questions about the nature of friendship and loyalty, and it highlights the consequences of ambition and greed. it is a film that will appeal to anyone who is interested in technology, business, or social media, and it is a must-see for anyone who wants to understand the story behind facebook.", "logprobs": [{"token": "the", "logprob": -0.11627468466758728}, {"token": " social", "logprob": -1.6927862816373818e-05}, {"token": " network", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.03940728306770325}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -1.3828373084834311e-05}, {"token": " film", "logprob": -0.24996495246887207}, {"token": " that", "logprob": -0.05464606732130051}, {"token": " tells", "logprob": -0.18567566573619843}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -7.152560215217818e-07}, {"token": " story", "logprob": -9.298368240706623e-06}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -3.218656047465629e-06}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.04119579493999481}, {"token": " founding", "logprob": -0.017032857984304428}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0005529859336093068}, {"token": " facebook", "logprob": -0.00015200339839793742}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.0788910835981369}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.00016094549209810793}, {"token": " subsequent", "logprob": -0.08091060072183609}, {"token": " lawsuit", "logprob": -2.7963266372680664}, {"token": " that", "logprob": -0.05421021580696106}, {"token": " followed", "logprob": -0.016397733241319656}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.011144519783556461}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.054935816675424576}, {"tok